message: "DNAKit is a development preview. Cite DNAKit plus every algorithm, database, and optional backend used by your workflow."
title: "DNAKit"
type: software
version: "0.1.0.dev0"
license: "MIT"
authors:
  - name: "DNAKit contributors"
abstract: "A development-stage Python toolkit for deterministic DNA sequence standardization, descriptors, thermodynamics, fingerprints, similarity, dataset curation, evaluation, molecular-biology simulation, and visualization."
keywords:
